<title>ABU DHABI: Abu Dhabi Hotels Co raises 96 revenue, net profit.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi Hotels Co raises 96 revenue, net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million dirhams)</p>
<p> Total revenue		645		 580</p>
<p> Net profit		   166.5	     153.8</p>
<p> Shareholder's equity     679		 580.6</p>
<p>Full Name: Abu Dhabi National Hotels Company</p>
<p>Note: At its annual general meeting on Sunday the company agreed to issue a total dividend of 66.5 million dirhams and to increase the company's capital to 150 million dirhams from 133.1 million dirhams.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +971 4 6071 222</p>
</text>
